---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { ArrowLeft, ShieldCheck, HardDrive, EyeOff, Lock } from 'lucide-astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — WYNTab"
  description="WYNTab Privacy Policy: Learn how WYNTab protects your privacy with 100% offline local storage and zero telemetry."
  canonicalPath="/privacy/"
>
  <Navbar />

  <main class="flex-1 py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full">
    <div class="mb-8">
      <a
        href="/"
        class="inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-sm text-neutral-400 hover:text-white transition-colors"
      >
        <ArrowLeft class="w-4 h-4" />
        <span>Back to Home</span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <article class="space-y-10">
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-[#2E2E2E] pb-8 space-y-3">
        <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-mono font-medium bg-[#10B981]/10 text-[#10B981] border border-[#10B981]/25">
          <ShieldCheck class="w-3.5 h-3.5" />
          <span>Chrome Web Store Privacy Disclosure</span>
        </div>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Privacy Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm font-mono text-neutral-400">
          Effective Date: October 2026 • WYNTab Open Source Extension
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Core Commitment Highlights -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#141414] border border-[#2E2E2E]">
          <EyeOff class="w-5 h-5 text-[#10B981] mb-2" />
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">Zero Analytics</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">No Google Analytics, telemetry, cookies, or tracking beacons.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#141414] border border-[#2E2E2E]">
          <HardDrive class="w-5 h-5 text-[#10B981] mb-2" />
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">100% Local Storage</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">Templates and configs are stored strictly inside your browser's local sandbox.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="p-4 rounded-xl bg-[#141414] border border-[#2E2E2E]">
          <Lock class="w-5 h-5 text-[#10B981] mb-2" />
          <h3 class="font-bold text-sm text-white mb-1">No Cloud Sync</h3>
          <p class="text-xs text-neutral-400">No account required and zero servers collecting user data.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Policy Sections -->
      <div class="space-y-8 text-neutral-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">1. Single Purpose & Data Minimization</h2>
          <p>
            WYNTab (Write Your NewTab) is an open-source browser extension designed solely to replace your default new tab page with custom HTML, CSS, and React templates. It requires minimal permissions and collects no data whatsoever.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">2. Information Collection and Storage</h2>
          <p>
            All custom code, configurations, notes, and preferences entered into WYNTab are saved locally on your device via the browser's native <code class="bg-[#181818] border border-[#2E2E2E] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-200 font-mono text-xs">chrome.storage.local</code> API.
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-neutral-400">
            <li><strong class="text-neutral-200">No Server Transmission:</strong> WYNTab has no backend database, API server, or analytics collection infrastructure.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-neutral-200">No Personal Information:</strong> We never inspect, collect, log, or sell personal identifiers, passwords, browsing history, or search queries.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-neutral-200">Data Portability:</strong> You maintain complete control over your data and may export or import your templates anytime via standard JSON files.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">3. Sandboxed Runtime Execution</h2>
          <p>
            To ensure complete device security, all custom user templates are executed inside an isolated Manifest V3 iframe sandbox (<code class="bg-[#181818] border border-[#2E2E2E] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-200 font-mono text-xs">sandbox.html</code>). Sandboxed code has no access to Chrome Extension management APIs, cookies, credentials, or other browser tabs. Communication between the sandbox and storage occurs strictly across a validated <code class="bg-[#181818] border border-[#2E2E2E] px-1.5 py-0.5 rounded text-neutral-200 font-mono text-xs">window.postMessage</code> bridge.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">4. Third-Party CDNs & External Resources</h2>
          <p>
            If you author or import a custom template that loads external scripts, styles, or media (for instance, Tailwind from <code class="text-neutral-200">cdn.tailwindcss.com</code> or ES modules from <code class="text-neutral-200">esm.sh</code>), those network requests are initiated directly by your browser to those third-party services. Those requests are governed by the privacy policies and terms of those external providers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">5. Open Source Verification</h2>
          <p>
            WYNTab is released under the Apache-2.0 license. The entire extension and website codebase is open-source and auditable on GitHub at <a href="https://github.com/getwyntab/wyntab" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#10B981] hover:underline">github.com/getwyntab/wyntab</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white">6. Contact & Inquiries</h2>
          <p>
            If you have questions regarding this Privacy Policy or wish to report a security inquiry, please open an issue on our <a href="https://github.com/getwyntab/wyntab/issues" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="text-[#10B981] hover:underline">GitHub Issues Tracker</a>.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
